# Roo Code Project Rules - Expense Tracker Pro

## Project Architecture
- Framework: React 19 + Vite 8
- UI Design: Pure CSS with CSS custom properties (no Tailwind)
- Feedback Tool: Agentation (mounted in App.jsx, connected to http://localhost:4747)
- Quality Control: Run `npm run build` after any code modification

## Development Guidelines
1. Visual Polish: Use modern glassmorphism, harmonious color tokens, and responsive layouts.
2. Agentation Integration: Preserve `<Agentation endpoint="http://localhost:4747" />` so developers can annotate UI components.
3. Component Separation: Keep state clean, modular, and maintainable.
4. When executing multi-step tasks, refer to `TODO.md` and check off completed items.
